	(text "Display rail qualification: BUCK2 3.2V +/-5% exceeds the panel 3.1-3.3V window.\nCheck both rails across supply, load and temperature. Wait for 5V to settle before\nthe Sharp start sequence; TPS63900 start-up is about 6ms typical, not a bound."
